OL,3,GNEWSARailway line to be shut for works
OL,4,Aafter landslip
OL,5,
OL,6,FA section of railway is set to be shut
OL,7,Ffor five days for emergency works
OL,8,Ffollowing a landslip, Network Rail has
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FEngineers will work from 28 October
OL,12,Funtil 1 November to stabilise the
OL,13,Frailway near Godstone in Surrey during
OL,14,Fwhich time buses will replace trains
OL,15,Fbetween Redhill and Tonbridge, in Kent.
OL,17,FA speed restriction has been put in
OL,18,Fplace along the section of railway
OL,19,Funtil the works can start.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,327,320,200,140,0,100
